<title>USA: Indian Prairie, Ill., school bonds won by EVEREN.</title>
<headline>Indian Prairie, Ill., school bonds won by EVEREN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>EVEREN Securities Inc. said Monday it won $29 million Indian Prairie Community Unit School District No 204, Ill., unlimited tax bonds at a net interest cost of 5.427 percent.</p>
</text>
